Package: rdmrtmb
Title: Frequentist Estimation of the Racing Diffusion Model with 'RTMB'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Henrik", "Singmann", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "singmann@gmail.com")
Description: Maximum likelihood estimation of the racing diffusion model of
    speeded decision making. Every model parameter is described by its own
    formula, collected with 'rdm_formula()', and random effects are written
    inside these formulas with lme4-style terms such as '(1 | id)'. Random
    effects are integrated with the Laplace approximation using automatic
    differentiation provided by 'RTMB'.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/singmann/rdmrtmb
BugReports: https://github.com/singmann/rdmrtmb/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
